{"version":3,"kind":"Notebook","sha256":"89f4a26ae04c1c926fe02e28d84d6c5909c88c2ff43f3987bf7d869378c9a19e","slug":"bmk-mmi","location":"/bmk_mmi.ipynb","dependencies":[],"frontmatter":{"title":"Benchmark de MMI 2×2","content_includes_title":false,"kernelspec":{"name":"python3","display_name":"Python 3","language":"python"},"github":"https://github.com/paulxshen/Luminescent.jl","numbering":{"title":{"offset":2}},"source_url":"https://github.com/paulxshen/Luminescent.jl/blob/main/docs/_es/bmk_mmi.ipynb","edit_url":"https://github.com/paulxshen/Luminescent.jl/edit/main/docs/_es/bmk_mmi.ipynb","exports":[{"format":"ipynb","filename":"bmk_mmi.ipynb","url":"/es/_public/bmk_mmi-dee149ae0126162cd4d95499fc6feb21.ipynb"}]},"widgets":{},"mdast":{"type":"root","children":[{"type":"block","kind":"notebook-content","children":[{"type":"paragraph","position":{"start":{"line":3,"column":1},"end":{"line":3,"column":1}},"children":[{"type":"text","value":"Compara Luminescent con Tidy3D y Lumerical FDTD usando el MMI 2×2 de Liu y Poon, ","position":{"start":{"line":3,"column":1},"end":{"line":3,"column":1}},"key":"R0f6kKmWwU"},{"type":"link","url":"https://arxiv.org/html/2506.16665v2","position":{"start":{"line":3,"column":1},"end":{"line":3,"column":1}},"children":[{"type":"text","value":"arXiv:2506.16665","position":{"start":{"line":3,"column":1},"end":{"line":3,"column":1}},"key":"c9abW7rmZF"}],"urlSource":"https://arxiv.org/html/2506.16665v2","key":"dIRuJyoit0"},{"type":"text","value":", Sec. 3.3. El dispositivo es el ","position":{"start":{"line":3,"column":1},"end":{"line":3,"column":1}},"key":"RVG30aZav1"},{"type":"inlineCode","value":"mmi2x2_with_sbend","position":{"start":{"line":3,"column":1},"end":{"line":3,"column":1}},"key":"OG2aqFK6kK"},{"type":"text","value":" genérico de GDSFactory: brazos de Si de 500 nm × 220 nm que se ensanchan mediante tapers a 700 nm antes de la región multimodo, con curvas en S en los cuatro puertos. El revestimiento de SiO2 está por encima y por debajo. El Si usa un ajuste lorentziano sin pérdidas del modelo de Palik del artículo (n = 3.4729 a 1550 nm); el SiO2 tiene un valor constante n = 1.4425. El dominio es el dispositivo más márgenes de 1 µm: 34 × 7 × 2.22 µm³ (el artículo usa 34 × 7.5 × 4 µm³). El modo TE0 entra por o1 (abajo a la izquierda) a 1550 nm con un ancho de banda de fuente de λ/12 (el artículo usa 20 nm). El umbral de apagado por energía es 1e-4 (1e-3 para nres ≤ 10; el artículo usa 1e-5). Reportamos la transmisión al puerto cruzado (o3), la pérdida en exceso, el tiempo de resolución y el pico de memoria en función de la resolución.","position":{"start":{"line":3,"column":1},"end":{"line":3,"column":1}},"key":"KhKluZlANL"}],"key":"Xqe8lkNv5S"},{"type":"paragraph","position":{"start":{"line":5,"column":1},"end":{"line":5,"column":1}},"children":[{"type":"text","value":"Valores del artículo (Tidy3D 2.7.7 en GPU en la nube, Lumerical 2025 R1 en una CPU de 24 núcleos; transmisión digitalizada de la Fig. 12a):","position":{"start":{"line":5,"column":1},"end":{"line":5,"column":1}},"key":"q737kW9zM0"}],"key":"W498CzotJE"},{"type":"table","position":{"start":{"line":7,"column":1},"end":{"line":13,"column":1}},"children":[{"type":"tableRow","position":{"start":{"line":7,"column":1},"end":{"line":7,"column":1}},"children":[{"type":"tableCell","header":true,"position":{"start":{"line":7,"column":1},"end":{"line":7,"column":1}},"children":[{"type":"text","value":"nres","position":{"start":{"line":7,"column":1},"end":{"line":7,"column":1}},"key":"dsB4674SgW"}],"key":"RrmCk7DmSi"},{"type":"tableCell","header":true,"position":{"start":{"line":7,"column":1},"end":{"line":7,"column":1}},"children":[{"type":"text","value":"T cruzada Tidy3D","position":{"start":{"line":7,"column":1},"end":{"line":7,"column":1}},"key":"ju1jTstcJp"}],"key":"kvsr2FetLG"},{"type":"tableCell","header":true,"position":{"start":{"line":7,"column":1},"end":{"line":7,"column":1}},"children":[{"type":"text","value":"T cruzada Lumerica